  "text": "This single-arm, multicenter, prospective phase II clinical study was conducted at 4 medical centers across China. The clinical trial was registered at ClinicalTrials.gov under the identifier NCT05348668. Eligible participants (18 to 75 years) had histologically confirmed stage IV driver-negative NSCLC (8th edition of the Tumor\u2013Node\u2013Metastasis [TNM] Staging System 24), Eastern Cooperative Oncology Group (ECOG) performance status 0 to 1, and adequate organ/bone marrow function. Exclusion criteria included driver mutations (e.g., epidermal growth factor receptor [EGFR], anaplastic lymphoma kinase [ALK], and ROS proto-oncogene 1 [ROS1]), pulmonary fibrosis, autoimmune disease, active infection, or serious comorbidities. All participants received 4 to 6 cycles of platinum-based doublet chemotherapy plus ICI. Participants without disease progression after comprehensive evaluation subsequently underwent Hybrid-RT during ICI maintenance. The comprehensive clinical trial protocol is provided in Data S1.",
